      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t vcpu \u003d\u003d shadow_state-\u003evcpu by this point? In which case, this collapses to:\n\n```\nif (shadow_state \u0026\u0026 shadow_state-\u003eis_protected)\n    return;\n```\n\nor perhaps:\n\n```\nif (!shadow_state || !shadow_state-\u003eis_protected)\n    __kvm_adjust_pc(vcpu);\n```",
